1
00:00:23,936 --> 00:00:28,675
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,675 --> 00:00:32,387
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,611 --> 00:00:34,856
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,104 --> 00:00:37,910
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,789 --> 00:00:43,317
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,317 --> 00:00:46,949
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,848
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:53,059 --> 00:00:55,555
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,555 --> 00:01:00,195
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,583 --> 00:01:02,144
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,144 --> 00:01:08,195
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,352 --> 00:01:12,075
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:12,075 --> 00:01:15,646
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:22,755
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,072 --> 00:01:26,824
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,824 --> 00:01:30,508
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,508 --> 00:01:35,523
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,523 --> 00:01:39,683
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,296 --> 00:01:46,848
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,456 --> 00:01:50,016
=Episode 2=

21
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,584
Master gave me this.

22
00:01:55,959 --> 00:01:58,784
He is dead now,
and I just keep it as a memento.

23
00:01:59,552 --> 00:02:01,024
Please give it back to me.

24
00:02:04,224 --> 00:02:06,359
Mr. Rong, you'd better tell the truth.

25
00:02:06,799 --> 00:02:09,184
Otherwise, no matter
who's protecting you,

26
00:02:09,184 --> 00:02:13,312
I can make you disappear without a trace
in the Governor Mansion.

27
00:02:13,472 --> 00:02:15,120
I am telling the truth.

28
00:02:15,719 --> 00:02:17,599
You are used to killing innocents.

29
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,919
If you want to kill me, just do it.
Stop talking nonsense.

30
00:02:36,192 --> 00:02:36,864
Bang!

31
00:02:43,879 --> 00:02:50,479
Mr. Rong, you have a delicate face,
but you got the courage of a man.

32
00:02:58,599 --> 00:03:02,080
Tell me, where is the real Buddha Head?

33
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:08,080
It's a secret that can save my life.
How could I tell you that easily?

34
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,439
Save your life?

35
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:13,400
You should beg me
to leave you a whole corpse.

36
00:03:14,439 --> 00:03:20,319
If I remember correctly,
you are not the one in charge here.

37
00:03:20,672 --> 00:03:24,392
If I tell the Governor my secret
to pledge my loyalty,

38
00:03:24,392 --> 00:03:27,520
I might even be able
to trade it for your life.

39
00:03:28,064 --> 00:03:29,400
Pledge loyalty?

40
00:03:29,664 --> 00:03:33,919
In my foster father's eyes,
you are nothing but an ant.

41
00:03:37,759 --> 00:03:39,456
Then kill me.

42
00:03:39,872 --> 00:03:43,800
Let the Buddha Head be buried with me
and the entire Rongqing Troupe forever,

43
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,719
and never come out again.

44
00:03:46,479 --> 00:03:49,039
Given how much the Governor
values the Buddha Head,

45
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:54,560
no matter how foolish you are,
I bet you wouldn't want to perish with me.

46
00:03:55,904 --> 00:03:57,680
They say actors are heartless.

47
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,719
I have kept your life until now.

48
00:04:01,319 --> 00:04:06,800
Yet you're showing no gratitude,
even going back on your word.

49
00:04:30,279 --> 00:04:31,000
(No.)

50
00:04:31,488 --> 00:04:35,456
(Killing him alone is not enough
to avenge the Rongqing Troupe.)

51
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:39,519
(What I want is the annihilation
of the entire Governor Mansion.)

52
00:04:41,312 --> 00:04:42,912
Miss Jiang, you can't go in.

53
00:04:43,279 --> 00:04:44,120
Move aside!

54
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:48,199
I am Young Marshal's future wife.
How dare you stop me?

55
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:53,279
Mr. Rong.

56
00:04:53,376 --> 00:04:55,296
You came at the perfect time.

57
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:04,360
You came to deliver medicine
to a man's room alone this late.

58
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:11,456
What's wrong? Why are you so scared
upon seeing your future husband?

59
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:19,648
Are you here to have an affair,
instead of delivering medicine?

60
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:23,639
I was just worried about
whether Mr. Rong could perform tomorrow.

61
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,800
If not,
the Governor Mansion might suffer.

62
00:05:26,439 --> 00:05:27,920
What are you doing here so late?

63
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:35,879
I also came to check on
Mr. Rong's wounds.

64
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:39,600
I don't want him to die silently
in the Governor Mansion.

65
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:48,439
But with you caring about him,
he probably won't die that soon.

66
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:56,920
Mr. Rong.

67
00:06:00,864 --> 00:06:03,456
- Mr. Rong, you...
- Since the medicine has been delivered,

68
00:06:03,456 --> 00:06:05,279
why are you still here?

69
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:09,760
Do you want
to spend a night here with me?

70
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,120
(Master.)

71
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:29,632
(Once I finish this last performance,
I will come join you)

72
00:06:30,319 --> 00:06:32,240
(and reunite with others
of Rongqing Troupe.)

73
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,856
(Governor Mansion)

74
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:47,199
Miss Jiang, today you and I
will share the stage?

75
00:06:47,759 --> 00:06:51,120
The first performance of yours I watched
was "A Garden Stroll".

76
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,839
At that time, I thought,

77
00:06:53,319 --> 00:06:58,920
if I had the chance to perform with you,
I would have no regrets in my life.

78
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:02,360
Miss Jiang,

79
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:05,560
today is not a good chance.

80
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:10,480
If there is another chance,
I will invite you to perform together.

81
00:07:10,839 --> 00:07:12,560
We could perform for three whole days.

82
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:14,360
Mr. Rong,

83
00:07:16,199 --> 00:07:20,879
today might be the last time
we see each other, so please indulge me.

84
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:25,279
Miss Jiang, why do you say that?

85
00:07:25,759 --> 00:07:29,120
After you were taken away yesterday,
I went to plead with my father.

86
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:34,560
He demanded that I never see you again
and marry Young Marshal Xu obediently.

87
00:07:35,319 --> 00:07:36,360
I agreed.

88
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:39,480
Because this is the only way
I could think of to save you.

89
00:07:39,904 --> 00:07:40,896
I've checked it out.

90
00:07:40,896 --> 00:07:43,879
During the noon banquet, all the guards
will be in the front courtyard,

91
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,680
and only one guard at the back gate.

92
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:51,160
Take this, and no one
will dare to stop you.

93
00:07:55,439 --> 00:07:57,664
(Qian Sihai, Hu Feng)
For this business to last long,

94
00:07:57,664 --> 00:07:59,360
(Special Envoys of Xiaosheng Society)
I have to rely on you two.

95
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:00,959
Cheers!

96
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,360
Great working with you.

97
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:04,920
Foster Father.

98
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:07,600
I'll go check on the stage preparations.

99
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:08,800
Mm.

100
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:13,560
You two wanted to watch the performance
of Mr. Rong. I bet he won't fail you.

101
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:22,480
This shipment of artifacts seems
to be missing what the Japanese wanted.

102
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:26,839
No business today, just relax.

103
00:08:27,519 --> 00:08:28,279
Alright.

104
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,519
No way.

105
00:08:29,959 --> 00:08:32,480
If I escape,
you will definitely be implicated.

106
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:37,879
I'm about to marry the Young Marshal.
They won't do anything to me.

107
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,200
But you,

108
00:08:42,368 --> 00:08:45,080
if you don't leave now,
you will lose your life.

109
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:51,488
I don't deserve you risking your life.

110
00:08:56,399 --> 00:08:57,056
Put it here.

111
00:08:57,056 --> 00:08:59,600
Inside that chest
is a set of servant's clothes.

112
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,879
During the set change
after the third act, I'll perform.

113
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:05,240
You'll put on these clothes
and take the chance to escape.

114
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:22,240
(But I have something I must do,
and I can't leave yet.)

115
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:29,559
I'll send men to guard the back gate.
Rong Xiaonan can't escape.

116
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,600
No.

117
00:09:32,159 --> 00:09:33,639
Let him escape.

118
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:38,759
This Rong Xiaonan is very cunning.
He would rather die than talk.

119
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,399
But if we let him escape,

120
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:47,320
send someone to follow him. Maybe we can
find the Jade Buddha Head's whereabouts.

121
00:09:47,759 --> 00:09:48,559
Yes.

122
00:09:49,399 --> 00:09:50,240
By the way,

123
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:52,159
as per your previous instructions,

124
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:55,296
we have replaced everyone
near the west wing rooms

125
00:09:55,296 --> 00:09:57,216
where the Xiaosheng Society is
with our own men.

126
00:09:59,399 --> 00:10:00,949
I need to find out

127
00:10:02,144 --> 00:10:05,840
what business Foster Father is doing
with Xiaosheng Society.

128
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:12,608
Search carefully.

129
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:22,784
A list.

130
00:10:22,784 --> 00:10:23,840
(Inventory List)

131
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:33,888
So the business Foster Father
and Xiaosheng Society are doing

132
00:10:35,510 --> 00:10:37,159
is artifacts smuggling.

133
00:10:54,688 --> 00:10:55,744
Young Lady.

134
00:10:56,159 --> 00:10:57,720
Young Lady.

135
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,560
Mr. Qian,

136
00:11:07,159 --> 00:11:08,384
pleasure working with you.

137
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,696
Likewise.

138
00:11:11,277 --> 00:11:13,248
♪Spring, oh spring♪

139
00:11:13,716 --> 00:11:18,112
♪I must linger with you♪

140
00:11:19,328 --> 00:11:27,608
♪How to pass the time
when spring is gone♪

141
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:32,928
♪Such weather♪

142
00:11:54,528 --> 00:11:55,679
(Mr. Rong.)

143
00:11:56,039 --> 00:12:00,256
(I hope we could meet again after this.)

144
00:12:00,919 --> 00:12:01,984
(Don't worry.)

145
00:12:02,528 --> 00:12:06,016
(No matter what happens,
I will definitely hold them back)

146
00:12:06,559 --> 00:12:08,440
(to ensure you leave safely.)

147
00:12:30,496 --> 00:12:31,776
♪As if it were fate♪

148
00:12:31,776 --> 00:12:33,248
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

149
00:12:33,695 --> 00:12:36,932
♪We miss each other♪

150
00:12:38,176 --> 00:12:39,744
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

151
00:12:39,744 --> 00:12:42,144
♪And a bizarre♪

152
00:12:42,144 --> 00:12:44,946
♪Anonymous legend♪

153
00:12:45,476 --> 00:12:47,488
♪The plot twists and turns♪

154
00:12:47,636 --> 00:12:49,376
♪Play out over and over again♪

155
00:12:49,376 --> 00:12:52,440
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

156
00:12:52,736 --> 00:12:54,720
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

157
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:55,712
♪Refuse to submit♪

158
00:12:55,712 --> 00:12:58,912
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

159
00:13:00,576 --> 00:13:03,488
♪There are always too many♪

160
00:13:03,488 --> 00:13:05,376
♪Helpless situations♪

161
00:13:05,376 --> 00:13:08,000
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

162
00:13:09,131 --> 00:13:11,091
♪Even if I have questions♪

163
00:13:11,091 --> 00:13:13,091
♪I harbor desires♪

164
00:13:13,091 --> 00:13:15,968
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

165
00:13:16,319 --> 00:13:17,952
♪People come and go♪

166
00:13:17,952 --> 00:13:20,768
♪I'm still all alone♪

167
00:13:20,768 --> 00:13:23,496
♪Wandering around♪

168
00:13:23,744 --> 00:13:26,597
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

169
00:13:26,597 --> 00:13:31,058
♪Go through the entanglement♪

170
00:13:31,424 --> 00:13:33,152
♪If longing♪

171
00:13:33,152 --> 00:13:36,311
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

172
00:13:36,311 --> 00:13:39,066
♪How can I be at ease♪

173
00:13:39,168 --> 00:13:41,482
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

174
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:43,456
♪And travelled around the world♪

175
00:13:43,552 --> 00:13:46,640
♪Scars all over me♪

176
00:13:46,912 --> 00:13:49,824
♪If longing never fades♪

177
00:13:49,824 --> 00:13:51,273
♪Burns still hot♪

178
00:13:51,273 --> 00:13:54,352
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

179
00:13:54,624 --> 00:13:56,481
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

180
00:13:56,544 --> 00:13:57,728
♪In the next life♪

181
00:13:57,728 --> 00:14:02,208
♪Entangle with you again♪
